### API v1 — individual messages > GET /api/v1/message/{id}

Source: https://github.com/axllent/mailpit/blob/develop/_autodocs/endpoints.md

## API v1 — individual messages (`{id}` may be the literal `latest`)

### `GET /api/v1/message/{id}`
Full message JSON (`Message` type, [types.md](types.md)). Marks the message as read. Status: 200, 404, 400.

